   "body": "Q: Tell me about your work in a few sentences: what you do, for whom, and with whom. Add any other part of your life you want the brain to hold (a second business, personal projects). If there is a folder or a repo with a project's plans, name it too.\nA: I'm a project lead at a small renovation studio, Northwind Interiors. My main client is Harbor Lane Homes: we're renovating their kitchen and bath, the Harbor Lane renovation, due in spring. I'm also pitching a cafe fit-out for Bluebird Cafe. I work most with Robin Vale, the site manager at Harbor Lane Homes; Jamie Ortiz, a freelance electrician; Priya Shah, my partner at the studio; Leo Brandt, who owns Bluebird Cafe; and Mina Cho, our supplier at Tilecraft. At home I'm planning a garden redesign this summer. No folder or repo to adopt.\n\nQ: The seeding preview (Domains, Areas, Projects, Orgs, People, Key documents). Answer with \"yes to all\", a range, a change, or \"drop N\".\nA: yes to all\n"
